{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105589","id":2470127763,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TOyiT","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105589","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105589.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105589.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105589","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105589/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105589/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105589/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1bb6acb8e1428c5178f11a02b8e8bc0353c787c1","number":105589,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[ScrollContainer] Add option to hold child at maximum scroll value when resized","user":{"login":"Koyper","id":33969780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTY5Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33969780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper","html_url":"https://github.com/Koyper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds `Resize Behavior` properties `hold_when_max_horizontal` and `hold_when_max_vertical` that keep the end of the `ScrollContainer` child pinned to the end of the `ScrollContainer` when resized. This is essential for things like a typical stack of messages that fill in from the `Control` bottom, or left side `SplitContainer` panels where it's unnatural for the current default behavior where the control is subsumed on the right side instead of shifting left as expected.\r\n\r\nThis PR essentially makes a top or left resizable `ScrollContainer` behave like a mirror image of a right or bottom resizeable `ScrollContainer`.\r\n\r\nWhile this can be simulated by scripting using the `item_rect_changed` signal on the child `Control`, it is impossible to avoid nasty jittering of the child during resize, especially if the child `Control`changes size in the axis of the scroll after being added to the scene tree.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/49eabf93-353b-4465-9b6c-aef9268e74d5\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/21cd8da5-7ffa-460a-ab6c-01d9394171f4\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18ab1e17-be59-4abb-a57c-497d137e627b\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12280*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issu